tps://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png\"]}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-21 11:01:38','2026-03-21 11:01:38'),(684,88,'text','周末小聚的治愈系东南亚菜馆?','周末和朋友打卡了这家东南亚菜馆，绿植环绕的环境超治愈，满满一桌菜看着就有食欲，冬阴功汤、特色烤物都很正宗，抹茶吐司冰更是惊喜，和朋友边吃边聊，太惬意啦?！',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"source\": 0, \"oss_ids\": [6248474, 6248473], \"original_id\": 2680, \"material_ids\": \",1467058,1467057,\"}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(685,88,'image','周末小聚的治愈系东南亚菜馆?',NULL,'https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png','https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png',684,'{\"original_id\": 2680, \"all_image_urls\": [\"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png\", \"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/a4e7c32e441ff044937e80fcce659745.png\"]}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(686,88,'text','周末聚会的快乐是东南亚菜给的?','周末和好友的聚餐选对地方啦！满满一桌东南亚风味菜，每道都不踩雷，酸辣开胃的热菜配上清爽的椰饮?，最后来份抹茶吐司冰和芒果小食解腻，环境也很适合拍照，聚会幸福感拉满！',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"source\": 0, \"oss_ids\": [6248474, 6248473], \"original_id\": 2679, \"material_ids\": \",1467058,1467057,\"}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(687,88,'image','周末聚会的快乐是东南亚菜给的?',NULL,'https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png','https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png',686,'{\"original_id\": 2679, \"all_image_urls\": [\"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png\", \"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/a4e7c32e441ff044937e80fcce659745.png\"]}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(688,88,'text','周末聚会挖到宝藏东南亚菜馆?','周末和朋友约的这家店太惊喜啦！环境像小森林一样治愈?，菜品种类超丰富，冬阴功汤酸辣够劲，各种烤物、小炒都很下饭?。还有超火的抹茶吐司冰，搭配椰奶甜品，一口就爱上，聚会氛围感直接拉满！',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"source\": 0, \"oss_ids\": [6248474, 6248473], \"original_id\": 2678, \"material_ids\": \",1467058,1467057,\"}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(689,88,'image','周末聚会挖到宝藏东南亚菜馆?',NULL,'https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png','https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png',688,'{\"original_id\": 2678, \"all_image_urls\": [\"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png\", \"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/a4e7c32e441ff044937e80fcce659745.png\"]}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(690,88,'text','泰式料理的快乐谁懂啊?','挖到一家氛围感泰式小馆！? 餐桌被各种色彩鲜亮的菜品摆满，青酱吐司冰淇淋创意拉满，芒果糯米饭香甜软糯，还有热辣的干锅菜和冬阴功汤，健康美味两不误，吃完幸福感爆棚～',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"source\": 0, \"oss_ids\": [6248474], \"original_id\": 2677, \"material_ids\": \",1467058,\"}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(691,88,'image','泰式料理的快乐谁懂啊?',NULL,'https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png','https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png',690,'{\"original_id\": 2677, \"all_image_urls\": [\"https://pyp-xmt.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/1/4/157/material/20260108/png/fe7a25b5820aa0089cadbb7a4a34b487.png\"]}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(692,88,'text','藏在绿植小院里的泰式美味?','被绿植包围的泰式小馆太治愈啦～? 满满一桌菜品色彩超丰富，青酱吐司配冰淇淋甜而不腻，还有椰香满满的椰子饭，冬阴功汤酸辣开胃，每一口都是地道的东南亚风味，健康又好味！',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"source\": 0, \"oss_ids\": [6248474], \"original_id\": 2676, \"material_ids\": \",1467058,\"}',0,'import',1,'2026-03-18 16:57:21','2026-03-18 16:57:21'),(693,88,'image','藏在绿植小院里的泰式美味?'